瓦的建筑，墙体可能略带斑驳，显得古朴静谧。\n地面：​ 路面由大块的石板铺就，增强了古镇的氛围。\n光线：​ 晴朗的白天，阳光柔和地洒在人物和街道上，形成温暖的光影，营造出温馨、惬意的氛围。\n4. 构图与氛围：\n构图：​ 采用以人物为中心的构图，人物位于画面中部，姿态自然，可能正在行走或站立。\n氛围：​ 整体氛围清新、自然、充满青春活力。人物的甜美气质与古朴的街道背景形成一种和谐又充满朝气的对比。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 18, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [7], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 262], "pos": [1051.5780029296875, 125.45628356933594], "widgets_values": [374581945737502, "randomize", 10, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 17, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 76, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 5, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 6, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CFG"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样器"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "label": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "label": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node n